Version 0.51.3 ships supported Ruby and Elixir implementations. Ruby provides
separate Bluesky and Mastodon applications; Elixir provides both modes in one
application. Elixir dependency attribution and corresponding source are
documented in elixir/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and included with Elixir packages.

Safeguards are part of both implementations. AI-generated text requires
interactive review. Privacy exclusions, opt-outs, do-not-contact enforcement,
harassment screening, interaction budgets, ownership validation, and uncertain
publication handling apply before publication. Automatic likes, favourites,
boosts, and reposts are disabled.

Do not use ChorusDraft to harass, threaten, dox, impersonate, coordinate abuse,
evade a request to stop contact, or publish private material. Operators remain
responsible for credentials, configuration, reviewed output, account conduct,
and compliance with platform rules and applicable law.

